      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} I don't think I can give you any logs now, because this happened a while ago. Checking my folder, I don't think I have those logs for that date anymore, but I can try to give some more info.\n\nMe and a group of people were in a public world that had a lot of people in it. This is the world: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_4b341546-65ff-4607-9d38-5b7f8f405132\n\nIf I recall correctly, while we were here, this world was at max capacity.\n\nAs for reproduction steps, I dropped a Group+ portal to a world that was not public. I was a moderator of that group and had the ability to drop unlocked portals. (side note: you can't change this option when you drop a portal without being in the new instance creation menu.) I tried dropping a portal to the instance and I could see it, as well as a few other people, but most other people could NOT see the portal.\n\nWe also tried this later with a very small number of people, about six or so, in a different world with a different Group Public instance that I don't know anything about and with no one familiar in it, but anyone that was not on my friend's list could see that portal at all.",
